('127.411.d.7.B',4,'The motion that comes out of a mechanism, such as a slider moving, is the:','["input", "output", "error", "constraint"]'::jsonb,1,'The output is the resulting motion.','original'),
('127.411.d.7.C',3,'A mechanism that transmits rotation between toothed wheels is a:','["belt", "screw jack", "gear train", "spring"]'::jsonb,2,'Gears mesh to pass rotation.','original'),
